WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.967
This is the Energy Management Division Digital Platform,

2
00:00:06.967 --> 00:00:10.668
from the National Cleaner Production Centre, Sri Lanka.

3
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:13.810
Seven energy audit tools, in one place,

4
00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:16.241
on your phone and on your computer.

5
00:00:17.733 --> 00:00:21.622
Behind the platform is the Energy Management Division team.

6
00:00:22.033 --> 00:00:25.570
The team is led by the Head of the Energy Department,

7
00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:29.508
a Senior Energy Expert, who took over from the former head.

8
00:00:29.933 --> 00:00:32.386
Five engineers complete the team,

9
00:00:32.386 --> 00:00:35.360
carrying out energy audits for industry,

10
00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:38.185
hospitals and hotels across Sri Lanka.

11
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:41.073
Tap Meet the team on the welcome page,

12
00:00:41.073 --> 00:00:45.107
and turn each card to see their experience and qualifications.

13
00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.141
Open the platform with the access code.

14
00:00:49.567 --> 00:00:52.312
Each tool then asks for its own app code,

15
00:00:52.312 --> 00:00:54.254
so your work stays protected.

16
00:00:56.433 --> 00:00:59.201
First, LuxLog, the lighting survey app.

17
00:00:59.633 --> 00:01:02.070
Sketch each room, tap where you measured,

18
00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:03.556
and type the lux reading.

19
00:01:04.833 --> 00:01:12.204
Every reading is checked against the JIS Z9110 range and the OSHA minimum.

20
00:01:12.633 --> 00:01:15.987
You see at once which areas are good, low or high.

21
00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:18.353
The lux map colours the floor,

22
00:01:18.353 --> 00:01:20.827
to show the bright and the dark areas.

23
00:01:22.133 --> 00:01:25.463
Then see the whole room in 3D, with the furniture,

24
00:01:25.463 --> 00:01:27.994
the lights and every reading in place.

25
00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:34.577
LuxLog writes the Word report and the Excel workbook for you,

26
00:01:34.577 --> 00:01:37.732
with a drawing and a table for every section.

27
00:01:39.533 --> 00:01:41.108
Next, the calculators.

28
00:01:41.108 --> 00:01:45.187
Each one is built from the division's own Excel workbook,

29
00:01:45.187 --> 00:01:47.334
and follows the same formulas.

30
00:01:48.633 --> 00:01:52.532
Rooftop solar. Size the system, and see the generation,

31
00:01:52.532 --> 00:01:56.431
the cost saving, the payback and the net present value.

32
00:01:57.733 --> 00:02:00.536
Boiler efficiency, by the indirect method,

33
00:02:00.536 --> 00:02:02.004
with every loss shown.

34
00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:05.487
Air compressor replacement savings.

35
00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:10.232
And air conditioning savings, from inverter and VRF units.

36
00:02:11.533 --> 00:02:15.743
Change a highlighted box, and every result updates instantly.

37
00:02:16.167 --> 00:02:18.663
Critical inputs are marked with a star,

38
00:02:18.663 --> 00:02:22.311
and model checks confirm that the numbers are consistent.

39
00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:28.027
The sub-meter verification report compares each meter with the logger,

40
00:02:28.027 --> 00:02:30.619
and flags every error outside your limit.

41
00:02:31.033 --> 00:02:34.509
Add photos, the calibration sheet and your signature.

42
00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:40.189
The Smart ESO Sheet lists every energy saving opportunity,

43
00:02:40.189 --> 00:02:45.336
with the cost and greenhouse gas saving worked out for each measure.

44
00:02:45.767 --> 00:02:49.383
And it works like Excel. Type equals, click the cells,

45
00:02:49.383 --> 00:02:51.057
and the formula is built.

46
00:02:51.467 --> 00:02:54.340
Copy, paste, fill and undo all work too.

47
00:02:55.933 --> 00:02:57.016
When you finish,

48
00:02:57.016 --> 00:03:00.738
the Download buttons at the top right give you the Word

49
00:03:00.738 --> 00:03:02.767
report and the Excel workbook,

50
00:03:02.767 --> 00:03:03.715
ready to send.

51
00:03:04.133 --> 00:03:07.272
Your work is saved on your own device as you type.

52
00:03:09.067 --> 00:03:12.387
The Energy Management Division Digital Platform.

53
00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:15.877
Developed by Vihindu Jayawardena.

